[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141000432","pull_request_review_id":2918580995,"id":2141000432,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_nRLw","diff_hunk":"@@ -311,9 +311,7 @@ void EditorDebuggerNode::stop(bool p_force) {\n \n \t// Also close all debugging sessions.\n \t_for_all(tabs, [&](ScriptEditorDebugger *dbg) {\n-\t\tif (dbg->is_session_active()) {\n-\t\t\tdbg->_stop_and_notify();\n-\t\t}\n+\t\tdbg->stop();","path":"editor/debugger/editor_debugger_node.cpp","commit_id":"09f5be761c2a831320727eb5213a8528d8d7a1c6","original_commit_id":"a3a7f8cb8213933dc512044bf40d4fed7c34a047","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Why is this change necessary? It would seem to affect all platforms","created_at":"2025-06-11T20:28:12Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T20:55:03Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2141000432","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141000432"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2141000432"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141000432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":314,"start_side":"LEFT","line":null,"original_line":314,"side":"RIGHT","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141163351","pull_request_review_id":2918818369,"id":2141163351,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_n49X","diff_hunk":"@@ -311,9 +311,7 @@ void EditorDebuggerNode::stop(bool p_force) {\n \n \t// Also close all debugging sessions.\n \t_for_all(tabs, [&](ScriptEditorDebugger *dbg) {\n-\t\tif (dbg->is_session_active()) {\n-\t\t\tdbg->_stop_and_notify();\n-\t\t}\n+\t\tdbg->stop();","path":"editor/debugger/editor_debugger_node.cpp","commit_id":"09f5be761c2a831320727eb5213a8528d8d7a1c6","original_commit_id":"a3a7f8cb8213933dc512044bf40d4fed7c34a047","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is a bug I found while testing, which I think affect all platforms.\r\n\r\nWhen `EditorDebuggerNode::stop(...)` is invoked, if the debugging session doesn't have an active session, it won't be stopped alongside `EditorDebuggerNode`, so it'll continue `processing` because `set_process(false)` is only invoked in `ScriptEditorDebugger::stop()`.\r\n\r\nThis'll cause:\r\n1. `_stop_and_notify()` in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/editor/debugger/script_editor_debugger.cpp#L1115 to be invoked\r\n2.  which will fire a [`stopped` signal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/editor/debugger/script_editor_debugger.cpp#L1230)\r\n3. which will cause `EditorDebuggerNode::_debugger_stopped` to be invoked because of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/editor/debugger/editor_debugger_node.cpp#L108\r\n4. which will trigger [`notify_all_debug_sessions_exited`](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/51b0379e5502402d44818a4b6f301f544a5754f3/editor/editor_node.cpp#L4927)\r\n5. which invokes `project_run_bar->stop_playing()`\r\n6. which in turn invokes `EditorDebuggerNode::get_singleton()->stop()` again\r\n\r\nIn most cases, it's not an issue because `EditorRunBar::stop_playing()` abort early when nothing is playing, but it becomes an issue when a project is playing after the first call to `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()`, as the call in `(5)` will cause the running project to be stopped as a consequence of the described flow.\r\n\r\nSo the fix is to always invoke `ScriptEditorDebugger::stop()` when `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()` is invoked in order to also stop `processing` for `ScriptEditorDebugger`.  `_stop_and_notify()` is not used to avoid invoking `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()` again when the `stopped` signal is fired.\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2025-06-11T21:42:23Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T21:42:24Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2141163351","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141163351"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2141163351"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2141163351/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":314,"start_side":"LEFT","line":null,"original_line":314,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2141000432,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2142639262","pull_request_review_id":2920986672,"id":2142639262,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc5_thSe","diff_hunk":"@@ -311,9 +311,7 @@ void EditorDebuggerNode::stop(bool p_force) {\n \n \t// Also close all debugging sessions.\n \t_for_all(tabs, [&](ScriptEditorDebugger *dbg) {\n-\t\tif (dbg->is_session_active()) {\n-\t\t\tdbg->_stop_and_notify();\n-\t\t}\n+\t\tdbg->stop();","path":"editor/debugger/editor_debugger_node.cpp","commit_id":"09f5be761c2a831320727eb5213a8528d8d7a1c6","original_commit_id":"a3a7f8cb8213933dc512044bf40d4fed7c34a047","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Ah, ok. I walked through the code, and the chain of events you describe makes sense. However, are you sure there aren't any cases where something is expecting `EditorDebuggerNode::stop()` to lead to `ScriptEditorDebugger`'s `\"stopped\"` signal being emitted, and now it won't be?\r\n\r\nThis change should probably be reviewed by someone who understands the debugger really well. Perhaps @Faless? I don't know who else knows this code? cc @akien-mga ","created_at":"2025-06-12T12:41:01Z","updated_at":"2025-06-12T12:41:01Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2142639262","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2142639262"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103972#discussion_r2142639262"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103972"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2142639262/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":314,"start_side":"LEFT","line":null,"original_line":314,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2141000432,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","original_position":7,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2143354732","pull_request_review_id":2922181701,"id":2143354732,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO